  "2026-10-21T20:15:46.510Z","harness:codex","Independent evidence for alert49: SARIF analysis1999462117 matches main29b4ab7e. Observation tier.fields flows through projectedState:799-804 and assignProjectedPath:777 into parseFieldPath:537-551. The synchronous Array.some guard throws for every empty or prototype-mutating segment before sink790; no later decoding restores such keys. Existing source regression declarations include __proto__.polluted and constructor.value. GitHub alert is dismissed as false positive. This is static triage; no exploit execution or new runtime security proof is claimed. The explicit governance waiver records why no new product gate is justified and expires November21 for review; existing scanner and coverage gates are unchanged."
